{
  "label": "MiniMax H3 Image Edit",
  "order": 8,
  "description": "The official MiniMax-H3-Image edit graph (int8 DiT + Qwen3-VL-32B encoder, 6 steps, euler, cfg 1) with up to 16 images: the first image is the edit target, scaled to about 4 MP, and the output takes its size; the rest are references. Refer to them with @image_1..@image_16 (type @ in the prompt); they reach the model as <Picture 1>..<Picture 16>. The prompt expander (Qwen3.5-9B) looks at the images and rewrites a short instruction into a full description of the result; turn it off with the Enable PE? switch in the workflow to send your prompt as written.",
